p signing key\'s encryption strength does not meet Google Play\'s recommended minimum standard":"Le niveau de chiffrement de votre cl\xe9 de signature d\'application n\'est pas conforme \xe0 la norme minimale recommand\xe9e par Google\xa0Play","Your app store couldn\'t be created":"Impossible de cr\xe9er votre magasin d\'applications","Your app store policies":"R\xe8gles concernant votre magasin d\'applis","Your app store processes_Header for a section where the developer declares their app store processes, such as support and legal request handling.":"Processus li\xe9s \xe0 votre magasin d\'applis","Your app store will be shown on this page. To get started, create your app store.":"Votre magasin d\'applications sera affich\xe9 sur cette page. Pour commencer, cr\xe9ez-le.","Your app strings are being automatically translated using Gemini models":"Les cha\xeenes de votre appli sont traduites automatiquement \xe0 l\'aide des mod\xe8les Gemini","Your app targets Android 13 (API 33) or above. You must declare the use of advertising ID in Play Console.":"Votre appli cible Android\xa013 (API\xa033) ou une version ult\xe9rieure. Vous devez d\xe9clarer l\'utilisation de l\'identifiant publicitaire dans la Play\xa0Console.","Your app targets Android 13 or later and registers non-system broadcast receivers without specifying their export behavior in certain places. Update your app so it specifies the export behavior for registered broadcast receivers.":"Votre appli cible Android\xa013 ou version ult\xe9rieure et enregistre des broadcast receivers hors syst\xe8me sans sp\xe9cifier leur comportement d\'exportation \xe0 certains endroits. Mettez \xe0 jour l\'appli de sorte qu\'elle sp\xe9cifie le comportement d\'exportation des broadcast receivers enregistr\xe9s.","Your app targets countries / regions that have specific requirements for medical device apps. Some of the information you provide will be shown to users on Google Play to help them decide which medical device apps are